            "id": "interface",
            "title": "公开 API 与入口",
            "html": "### 三个控制器共用的契约（39 行，%%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controller.py:13%%）\n\n~~~python\nclass StorageControllerInterface(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    def start(self):\n        \"\"\"\n        Start the storage controller.\n        This function should be implemented by subclasses to start\n        any necessary threads or processes.\n        \"\"\"\n        pass\n\n    @abstractmethod\n    def stop(self):\n        \"\"\"\n        Stop the storage controller.\n        This function should be implemented by subclasses to stop\n        any running threads or processes.\n        \"\"\"\n        pass\n\n    @abstractmethod\n    def report_status(self) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"\n        Return a status dict for this controller.\n\n        Must include at least ``is_healthy: bool``.\n        \"\"\"\n        pass\n~~~\n\n3 个方法，所以\"加一个控制器\"的成本很低。\n\n### 两个策略的接口\n\nStorePolicy（%%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/store_policy.py:49%%），两个决策：\n\n| 方法 | 决定什么 |\n|---|---|\n| %%select_store_targets(keys, adapters)%%（%%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/store_policy.py:60%%）-> %%dict[int, list[ObjectKey]]%% | 每个 key 该存到哪几个 L2 |\n| %%select_l1_deletions(keys)%%（%%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/store_policy.py:80%%）-> %%list[ObjectKey]%% | 存成功之后，要从 L1 删哪些（**实际方法名不是 %%should_remove_from_l1%%**） |\n\nPrefetchPolicy（%%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/prefetch_policy.py:21%%），决定\"取回来之后留不留\"：\n%%select_load_plan()%%（:31）选每个 key 由哪个 adapter 取，%%select_l1_retentions()%%（:53）决定取回后留不留。\n\n### 入口\n\n| 入口 | 位置 | 用途 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 控制器构造 | %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_manager.py:150%%（Store）· %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_manager.py:159%%（Prefetch）· %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_manager.py:84%% / %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_manager.py:142%%（L1/L2 Eviction） | 三个控制器各自 start()（%%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/store_controller.py:303%% · %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/prefetch_controller.py:594%%） |\n| 策略工厂 | %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/store_policy.py:125%%（%%create_store_policy%%）· %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/prefetch_policy.py:110%%（%%create_prefetch_policy%%） | 按配置选策略 |\n| AdapterDescriptor | %%lmcache/v1/distributed/storage_controllers/store_policy.py:22%% | 策略看到 adapter 的唯一形态 |\n\n### 扩展点\n\n| 想做的事 | 怎么做 |\n|---|---|\n| 换存哪几个 L2 的规则 | 实现 StorePolicy → 在构造处置入 |\n| 换取回来留不留的规则 | 实现 PrefetchPolicy |\n| 加一个新控制器 | 实现 StorageControllerInterface（3 方法） |"
