            "html": "### 依赖谁\n\n| 依赖 | 用来做什么 | 位置 |\n|---|---|---|\n| %%vllm.model_executor.layers.quantization%% | 注册表与基类：%%register_quantization_config%%、%%QUANTIZATION_METHODS%%、%%QuantizationConfig%% | %%vllm_ascend/quantization/modelslim_config.py:39%%、%%vllm_ascend/quantization/fp8_config.py:8%% |\n| %%vllm.model_executor.parameter%% | %%PerTensorScaleParameter%% 承载 input_scale 这类逐张量参数 | %%vllm_ascend/quantization/method_adapters.py:85%% |\n| %%torch_npu%% | 全部量化算子与格式转换：%%npu_quant_matmul%%、%%npu_dynamic_quant%%、%%npu_weight_quant_batchmatmul%%、%%npu_format_cast%% | 每个方法文件 |\n| %%compressed_tensors%% | 只在压缩张量路径上，读 %%QuantizationArgs%% 与 %%QuantizationStrategy%% | %%vllm_ascend/quantization/compressed_tensors_config.py:23%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend.utils%% | 三个方法名常量与 %%maybe_trans_nz%%、%%calc_split_factor%% | %%vllm_ascend/quantization/modelslim_config.py:44%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend.device.mxfp_compat%% | MX 族的 dtype 可用性断言，缺能力时提前报错 | %%vllm_ascend/quantization/methods/w4a4_mxfp4.py:29%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend.ops.fused_moe%% | MoE 的 %%select_experts%% 与 %%build_fused_experts_input%% | %%vllm_ascend/quantization/methods/w8a8_dynamic.py:29%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend.ascend_config%% | 读 %%enable_fused_mc2%% 与 %%dynamic_eplb%% 两个开关 | %%vllm_ascend/quantization/methods/w8a8_dynamic.py:26%% |\n\n### 被谁依赖\n\n| 调用方 | 用本模块的什么 | 位置 |\n|---|---|---|\n| %%vllm_ascend/platform.py%% | 触发注册、追加 %%--quantization%% 候选、启动早期自动探测 | %%vllm_ascend/platform.py:195%%、%%vllm_ascend/platform.py:199%%、%%vllm_ascend/platform.py:423%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend/worker/model_runner_v1.py%% | 建 KV cache 时问 dtype 与切分因子 | %%vllm_ascend/worker/model_runner_v1.py:4174%%、%%vllm_ascend/worker/model_runner_v1.py:4548%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend/attention/attention_v1.py%% | C8 前向与 FAKQuant 的反量化都实现于此 | %%vllm_ascend/attention/attention_v1.py:1675%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend/ops/linear_op.py%% | 融合矩阵乘加重通信时反查是不是 W8A8 静态 | %%vllm_ascend/ops/linear_op.py:367%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend/ops/fused_moe/%% | 用 %%QuantType%% 选 grouped matmul 分支 | %%vllm_ascend/ops/fused_moe/moe_mlp.py:36%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend/eplb/%% 与 %%vllm_ascend/attention/dsa_v1.py%% | 直接 import 具体 scheme 类 | %%vllm_ascend/eplb/adaptor/vllm_adaptor.py:27%%、%%vllm_ascend/attention/dsa_v1.py:35%% |\n| %%vllm_ascend/distributed/kv_transfer/%% | 读 KV 量化层号列表决定要不要在传输前量化 | %%vllm_ascend/distributed/kv_transfer/kv_p2p/mooncake_layerwise_connector.py:1888%% |\n\n### 一条反向的约束\n\n本模块把三个方法名常量定义在 %%vllm_ascend/utils.py:48%% 起，但它们的值 %%ascend%%、%%compressed-tensors%%、%%fp8%% 必须与宿主的命名一致，否则 %%register_quantization_config%% 注册的名字与用户传的字符串对不上。**这是一处没有测试保护的隐式契约**。"
